      "value": "So apparently the Beta client is no longer taking the mirror camera settings from the editor. But If you do not disable the script in the editor and call _MirrorUpdate in Start(), then it will work again during runtime.\n\nIs there a reason why the devs changed that behavior? is it a mistake or is it intentional?",
